{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1459,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a50043a9f09bcab0e7453a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了下次取材\n得好好考虑一下拍照姿势呢~\n呐训练员亲，可以帮我拍拍照吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f10da9b242104dcb5d0b0d560e59841292edc0c1018a3c1d98423b7b8de01ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f7e3f7d682588114c74f530",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和妈妈打完电话后\n就变得很想见她了……啊~啊，\n要是有私人飞机就能马上见到了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc538cd3bdf9f06a169185ebb2ef4ad9b94e0f78baae2f19e60d006fd44d0d82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92d576b4ba15494c5e6475ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阳光暖暖的，真是约会的好天气啊♪\n要不去塔顶吃绝景午餐怎么样~？",
      "source_fingerprint": "88bf40ec886db71cb4588826f98523a8361d0eababbf5d859798766610a68535",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a11c9c4ad80353c2200d30cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏季集训我也会带上这身泳装哦！\n沙滩漫步，还有海边咖啡厅打卡，\n一起好好享受吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "da6a1ce060318d942973f17623d51a06977c2ae2e3cbcadd0fae2d41c8969e51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40803c06d2c35a8173575690",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天时我们家会经常\n一起去兜风赏红叶呢~\n爸爸开车时的样子真的很帅♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "85021468acfc26fad4b9e430a4a9a341c481c3ba13a344f047c4fc463b0680e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17a15fadc411d2baa3e4f4b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天的度假村也很棒呢！\n在休息室边看雪边喝茶，\n简直棒到不行啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26d9aab062d18000b8eb8bbd6687f95510748592cd634849ad22e5bd3ecab3a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1477a49bbb97c4f1eb859ba9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我很喜欢蓝色，\n不过粉色也超可爱的啊。\n能让人变得悸动不已☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bbd2fb566d23e514f796af9e9803abab836fe4b303e6b28fe8fb7c2e2f7f8d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5fb8f4d4e221e49b8b1daee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我说想做同款美甲，结果得到回复\n说“只做脚趾甲的话没问题”♪\n欸嘿嘿，像是骏逸亲会说的话呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c3723e8b878e7ff881f8d47630c1119dfa77f81ae2c9b3c4641cc8cbed06d8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32cf428ad429c84d5a622b88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可是受到表扬就能成长的类型！\r\n要让我不断成长哦~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fd336ee5990e758d54b3813b08d5ab80aea558f0720dad68447dbf2889ed6ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac8ff45fb9b15bc0f4dc1aff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上喽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5cca6b23a11354d81064b55655ba4a571b6f902dbe2c6b2ff8852bd9068bc51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dfd32d5490b4253760f7861",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练菜单，\r\n为我考虑了很多吧？\r\n让我看看让我看看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f14ff0dba3766751ebd6793d5a139917aa7c819ca7744fa84a42fd1a452aa9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6ad53d9dd25ada8f0f0ac3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不断成长中☆\r\n希望目光别从我身上离开呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0da965bcacbc3abad7fbe1e99a93f3e89346d4b2abb2161c0a22be9420e56dfe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5218a81c3df415fd73a728bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐们也一定正在努力吧。\r\n我也不会输的~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c19e0c436fca2fb76f463d73e2fb50bf6806b2116295188af85e6d530daa631",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c262e117b8bee0ac4cd7993",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的奖励会是什么呢~\r\n是开心的事？还是好吃的东西？\r\n我很期待，多多关照啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b34da454e278e8a8f6db421c00528d66a3f90a33ad3fa1797aff2ddabee26efa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:105e88b788a7b7592a983f68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个那个，训练结束后有预定吗？\r\n我想去看看衣服。\r\n拜托了，我想和训练员亲一起去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14b4ad2875b8f04b8daf271b06a1c34e2c5ac4f1db331b2d573295a3cdc95d54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc42a8686749925e7ec62218",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去了迪拜后该做什么呢！\r\n参赛自然是不用说，\r\n也想享受两个人的私人时光呢♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "29136f336a2750a35bbfbf82f017d3aad9817098c521caa3d98429ca78424653",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:535276a041e67ee10632607f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蓝色的大海，白色的沙滩！\r\n这样的景色就像在度假胜地一样，\r\n我太喜欢了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea85abea1b01937aea91f6a97d839861c94b73d46e23a1796f03a10759b600c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80ff442920ee3244920fd6c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备OK！\n防晒霜也仔细涂上了哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "56d231351f5c36ca74d3ea7dc875097cb14ffba05d083f34564ea0355fe9704f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49ea680f7ec83ac418e8b64c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了享受上流的假期，\n现在得好好努力，对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "526940e7b0a6399b020725eb82e9df9d407796fc9e8b0fa4776f7ce194bd5e70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5878cfc89f9b17a4da44cdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练的时候，\n也想尽量享受其中乐趣呢~☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "d479f61c03f5c938c5a1278c5e11bdfdd9ad46d44c73590f2c3f3e4c82b6d915",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2ef38a282aa582f6f899b21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐说锻炼精神也很重要……\n呜呜，铁球训练什么的\n还是不要啦~……",
      "source_fingerprint": "de2815e54402e2d3eec129262ac221f5f6272d3c1d82a168ec3172c0f73cfe69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b5d582671fea3bcbbd6acdc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐~呐~来制定一下今天训练后的\n安排吧！是去吃东西？\n还是去购物？该选哪个呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "231c90f9f6c74dd63e2ba25dfac13e392af3b3915cd9a3ef60e92b423b558e2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d241eb2e100a607bfdcec0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还有很多地方想和训练员亲\n一起去呢！\n你会和我一起去的，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bb6345d054e7dc162f066c0c1217fd8fe436eb6badb7cb85b469e36c1dda15c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebac1762972798ffafe7ec16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员亲喜欢什么样的穿搭？\n可以的话我来帮训练员亲\n选一套合适的西装吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb776f62d85db15dbc81bb035de01a2858c65d1a864b74b7c5b4fbc725a159e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5af9339d08f19247a6f24cd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员亲喜欢什么样的穿搭？\n可以的话我来帮训练员亲\n选一套合适的礼服吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c98ad9d9f337f21922eb79c18c9dbaff3cc712e4c482ffa30d4cb7f44aec6f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "92122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:644146b3f80820016b3029ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很厉害吧！\r\n已经变得这么闪耀了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0be88dfb2508738f121715539d468cbd86ddd87e6eba80703d77b4a4aa11932",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ef163c80b02c7312c79c52f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员亲努力了，奖励你一朵小花！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01e73a9414766e4c019c85c3ce2530cbad43b76f2d541c472f37e1bd07a9fc30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e45c9eecc278ec92e2343cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起享受了最棒的假期呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5635e62a12eb8fcc0e803f558dd9ff0c9c01666973d0eab83522dca6660359e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:910639fda73f94a4358356a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是短暂却开心的旅程呢~☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "2850bef6115b6d102d0d9aafae49cfdcf420f021174aaf4dd8c053de9d24fa1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:518021a35b8e59ba12de5a54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变得更厉害了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f1643b977624337bc997a7a630078d4d06abec8324c77bd047a6f069e3f41c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86564c72ea86cc322ef15cec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "悸动停不下来了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cb1fbe129b41f9ec7bc17ea4c6cfb7c027b678d55c2f8e3da013b2c3aef80e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c556240c495a2742d63eb12c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是强击！\r\n一起好好相处吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ac40d8f92457fcecd88c01e1446206e2cd29ad404863157afaa0b18a0c929e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63a31d4e60522bbfd016307b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了成为闪闪发光的名流！\r\n和我一起悸动吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68da2898ecbe3e872b21884b37137c29c113ec894feeee21eac92f33e86d8ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c49e04dd33eeefa6925013d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会多多帮忙的哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "69bb89a9e775aa3c63aa7e40dac93216ce37bfdcc6897425dc966271b0bdcb63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9698c03a58675d57355b5df2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种事我也能办到哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "08811e02a2daf88b7cd849c899e5b53371bdbbdc97a911557169df158d2e8a36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4396cfa2efc27a3fca7c81af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名流等级，上升！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b25dcf47ceffd919fe8f504f286aff576add8d9bfd8be516a1c95fd168cd8b1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0df8a9a533d1d3f0a1b19222",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更更更闪耀了哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcdc5590f9b249f46123503260352d4a087d940aab0e506b6048430fc3127938",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4af934087e5de75a228921d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪闪发光的我变身☆\n一起好好享受假期吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "920aba012cd0a6a2897805236974928319685a7537fc4f1f32d66082ab417793",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e7cae817c839f87868ff686",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是强击哦！\n带着度假的心情出发吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f321bc396dff3247d1f2d5d052500cd5cee5bb1d82bfd2f5dc7a8fdd65ecdb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f950e6d8f1e490a3d24919e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "は～い、手伝いますね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5858d1bba5d33613f57fc5195336a04bc19d83fa77f7c59a49b0654c63011e08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e269c64ea2b15d97d238d39a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "わたしだっていつか主役に――なんて…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "920a3fb56645c90510bba822522982159501386b0ebfaa40a02c86b5efa62107",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af386d25218c8ad935cae8ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『安全でクリーンな実験だよ～！』\r\n…こ、こうかな？タキオンちゃんの\r\nおねだりどおりに宣伝できてる…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "80e5fc944cc5c7c135739533f4daf102e6776f18b55d70758d5941a8c8055de4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "900004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b6ba6554767709c6ee93d13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "え～っと、これで終わりですね！\r\nえへへ、お疲れさまでした～！\r\nさ～て、お片付けお片付け♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c416fc9106463a45106b08d057bd34dcd8e40b35d667a41d6fea07d05766916",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "900005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e29ac1076f3da86ff2ba9b6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お役に立てたみたいで\r\nよかったです。…研究の中身は\r\nよくわかってないですけど～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbd3d84102ce0118aef3f523d2616fbfe673f2ab04c3beb74af8d416cc7ea6a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "900006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b49f361e297bced11c4adec8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このレポート…ためになること\r\nいっぱい書いてありますよ！\r\n読んでみませんか～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4ad7eafa7a90e522e85e076f337c753c01d52857598d5a88b3c85e21bde834f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "900007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fda6d8af198fae73afc4474",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なんであれ、頑張ってるのを見ると\r\n応援したくなっちゃいますよね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65086543b730d1602917683ddaffd91e08a3509f7fe7b3b20b3e9e42e9332e39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "900008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e864b7d2e4ae740dc2f3bd07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "わたしだってやる時はやるんです！\r\n…あとは結果がついてきてくれると\r\nいいんですけど～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7737e1306aef20f23e86d24278693bae91f0eb7febecf6bc7f49cd90000a1dcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "900009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93c4b3efcb7201875be112df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これ全部達成できるくらいにドリンクを配れたら、\r\nフェスも盛り上がりますよね…よし、頑張ろうっと！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a94334e50d75db5567cf383a4070da768795951a8a513b068213da4ee0bebf1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "940000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74e78d26bec2d885ea8afc96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふぅ…これだけ配ればきっとお客さんも大丈夫…\r\nあ、あとで報酬もらうの忘れないようにしないと！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa17fcf017447df7acdda21bb2ec840337fc13fe49912c00f4a889ec1a0d54fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "940001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af1a9bf253aee0f8b40f027e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "わたしにできることなら！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f27c2d7159b0290b54a2f05c058e57285c81dc626a47e3c33b4fa3d233c757e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea131685828add85de6d2ade",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あ、それも手伝いますっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e28c7687d8bee51290de494282c072807ff790d319c8c15db2d2e567a934057f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0b1187ef0cb0539654a85d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全力で、いきます！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0edfce041c74dd68a9b45fd554801f6bf60a50343da20a560e7de361e5c1989a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ce8a6142abae42822c0b0f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おれ、走ります。いちばんの形で\r\n『ありがとう』を伝えるために。\r\nもらった全部を、返すために…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78996a1e8d0171bfc6964ff74c6c9c1b532d44819a239fe700ef8e02010a4fc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c46f13006ab8ea14b3fcd3ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "793275eb5254d9ee0aa95daa33c90a973bec2e4a987e75c094e5b5d339927bef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78bcf6e677597d4657884761",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戻りました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7cc6951a920e8084573735e4a0908d6d6b34e24b6a55a0aeb4ac698d3b94d9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3c965136cc4d5020d95e4df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おれを見つけてくれて、\r\nみんなに恩返しする機会もくれて…\r\n本当に、本当に…優しい人ですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73c08a5089fd84edc06c08ba3ffd276cff0e825b4b7cac2539df18bc7f8957d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1f7cb34fb537795a18130c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜の浜辺、気持ちよかったな。\r\n…あれ、本当に\r\nわがままのつもりだったんですよ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "48e4e412928d1547abf4874368c8ac4e793221305acd124b35474dca95b84d61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2a13a20b01124c9aaabd501",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毎年この時期は、病院のピアノで\r\nお正月ソングを弾くんです。\r\nささやかでも…楽しんでほしくて。",
      "source_fingerprint": "966013ab45f41a15b936cf774729ecda3748718ad83d3e7fc746549fe2cc8baf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:278086c453bc5cbbc7c757e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "チョコをたくさん作ってるうち、\r\nこんなにあげたい人がいるんだって\r\n嬉しくなって…幸せ者です、おれ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "842a5728d549c8e0ff33d7c6f2924893fd06c115641a7678ee64a30663eb0c9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97cd0ddbda6dd6d0a602f6a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "チョコ…もう少し持ってきてもいい\r\nですか？さっき渡したぶんだけじゃ\r\n伝えたい想いに足りない気がして。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18161a5b9b5f70d631e9386d471184b474fb7b92943c836a697b9fc68d070f94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ac0dd6be1e9a36aef9555fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "七夕の願い事かあ…天の川に\r\n消えない橋、かけてみたいです。\r\n織姫と彦星が、毎日会えるように。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd82a072a8388c051714a4a52212599481881b2359455774c225304781f111ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6f6ef17e2fbae8585a70926",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年はどんなのにしよう…ふふ、\r\n病院のハロウィンパーティーで配る\r\nお菓子、選ぶのが毎年楽しくて。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a42df573132924526269f7a46040b51f12396a5103315f5b93dba4f4d4685d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6923f6394c7318b2aa21bdc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "めりくり～…！…ど、どうですか？\r\nヘリオスみたいに場を盛り上げ\r\nられたらって思ったんです、けど。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27c28a0176e57e223e74ebf9ee48b33b9a25455550c9c9fcd5c67873e36f7c2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b076a882fd92016473d784cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬でも、クリスマスはあんまり\r\n寒くない気がします。みんなや…\r\nあなたが、笑ってるからかな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d96e2953308ce79c59fde6203f211f240cb9c4a76d75d7ffd5e77ef6724c08bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2ea08d70aad391a8ebeee74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よし！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e270ec23d5b6ff96972f8f7ce419fa9a68cfadaff85b8bd73e39c0e874c4c578",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce2da859dcd47217e62978e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うちのおせち、おれの好物だらけ\r\nで…おれの笑顔が、両親のご馳走\r\nなんですって。…いいのかなぁ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d19040c8852b14647e7007f297a90e121f676cf892acd25b5212809e442f38b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:673627e7a42240c9fa6a92af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お誕生日、おめでとうございます。\r\nお祝いの方法、ずっと考えてたので\r\nここ数日、すごく楽しかったです！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02fdaf73b9c4a93c6d8e4e6de7224bd9eb8b24aeee4ad8b577b74eff3a84ae7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9aed745dfe890ccfe685037c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プレゼント、喜んでもらえるかな…\r\nでも、たくさん考えたし…ヘリオス\r\nたちにも相談したし…って、あ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab57914affa04f9160ec9f260e29387fd68442fda46cf1659f33485bdbfe3daa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69b271717db1b51b3fa5fd72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日はヘリオスたちがサプライズで\r\nパーティーをしてくれるらしくて…\r\nあれ？おれ、知ってていいのかな？",
      "source_fingerprint": "54931fcebd331af95d5a43ed6ca0a345132577631588a44db5a9c32651f690a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4f34ea5b0d1d34e20b09e37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ありがとうございます！…ふふ、\r\nおかげさまで、一言じゃ全然\r\n足りないくらい、素敵な1年でした",
      "source_fingerprint": "0efa1445a65d5359dc7e1fb838ae28efbb00433f9c715df9176caf069f04d15b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf97b8d1b8ded4b31e48838b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お知らせがあるみたいです。\r\nよかったらおれ、\r\n見ておきましょうか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "92dbbe8599ab1c3396924b0f21960132233eaf8e7197ec06e7bbcfefbc5f0df5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:842de6de30554ee6e67a4df4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "わぁ、プレゼントが届いてますよ！\r\nふふっ、開けるのが楽しみですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac36c79bbe90d5b59de40728e277235eb7ab535eba6747026c64296d6bdab64e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37371ff2289ab79bbb6ddd25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ミッションクリアです。\r\nトレーナーさん、\r\nたくさん頑張りましたもんね…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7df5e654913841e63d885d319d472cd51f072e20bc692617c93b2ccd69577886",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fa32b3689d91b4cae215580",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もうすぐ、イベントが始まる\r\nみたいです。こういう催し、\r\n準備もわくわくしちゃいますね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbcd395a1258d26f4e302be1a8e1aef72cd436e88e0ac4e9a4eef8d99070b340",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d38fabec56cfd399437a46e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベント、始まってますね！\r\nみんな楽しそうで、\r\nおれまで嬉しくなっちゃうな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f593c980d1ce9f62e05efbdab21381a10e50020283c67d43d6ac6d6110d1721",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f544ba5bc9b7c9a88bfd33b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やるなぁ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcf9e663fb908943bdf76e4d451399bcc2c3f05ed8cf3fdd876d2a43638f597e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b39ffc9691c8f42f7e0108a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あ、名鑑レベルが\r\n上がったみたいです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7ae252958316e9a40f9aa9fc7f352eeb9d43106303f535aa5745bde4903409a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7154441393be78a292df63a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "互角…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4431f90c64253fff04f5af91c67e03712d8dcc00ca02c5245572ef01259d4fcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b70611411e58b519682cacde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "みんなの勝利、ですね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07cebd63c58a4ebb89c0f2eb14ee59a215c371537c482f52905bf2c398024a20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45c029796f2d69ea2ef0eb4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やるなぁ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcf9e663fb908943bdf76e4d451399bcc2c3f05ed8cf3fdd876d2a43638f597e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "1005"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
